OL,5,G1830 Canal Boat Diaries
OL,6,     FSowerby Bridge to Manchester:
OL,7,     FRobbie Cumming travels along the
OL,8,     FRochdale Canal from Sowerby Bridge
OL,9,     Fto Manchester, but disaster
OL,10,     Fstrikes when he runs aground.
OL,11,G1900 Canal Boat Diaries
OL,12,     FBarton Swing Aqueduct to
OL,13,     FLiverpool: Robbie Cumming
OL,14,     Fconcludes his journey by
OL,15,     Ftravelling from Barton Swing
OL,16,     FAqueduct to Liverpool Docks - but
OL,17,     Fexperiences engine problems on the
OL,18,     Fway.
